  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farmer Resilience and Rebuilding Initiative (FRRI)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Iniciativa de Resili&#xea;ncia e Reconstru&#xe7;&#xe3;o dos Agricultores (FRRI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">O projeto visa enfrentar amea&#xe7;as de longo e curto prazo provenientes de desastres naturais, clima e migra&#xe7;&#xe3;o urbana atrav&#xe9;s do apoio a esfor&#xe7;os de ajuda de emerg&#xea;ncia e &#xe0; reconstru&#xe7;&#xe3;o de infraestruturas, mercados e cadeias de valor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address long and short term threats from natural disasters, climate, and urban migration through support to emergency relief efforts and rebuilding infrastructure, markets, and value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
